NFO]    URL Slug:         \\n[INFO]  Clean article written to /tmp/crypto-article-clean.md\\n[INFO]  Title source: H1 heading (META block not found)\\n[INFO]  Excerpt source: first body paragraphs\\n[INFO]  Final Title:   Kevin Warsh Fed Chair Confirmation Passes Senate 54-45, Marking Historic Shift for Crypto Policy\\n[INFO]  Final Slug:    <WordPress auto-generate>\\n[INFO]  Post Status:   draft | Category ID: 3\\n[INFO]  Uploading featured image (283371 bytes)...\\n[INFO]  Image upload: HTTP 201\\n[INFO]  Image uploaded. Media ID: 65\\n[INFO]  Converting clean article to HTML...\\n[INFO]  Pandoc conversion successful.\\n[INFO]  Creating WordPress draft post (max 3 attempts)...\\n[INFO]  Post attempt 1 of 3...\\n[INFO]  Response: HTTP 201\\n[INFO]  Post created! ID: 66 | URL: https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=66\\n[INFO]  ================================================\\n[INFO]  SUCCESS — WordPress draft saved!\\n[INFO]    Post ID:   66\\n[INFO]    Post URL:  https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=66\\n[INFO]    Title:     Kevin Warsh Fed Chair Confirmation Passes Senate 54-45, Marking Historic Shift for Crypto Policy\\n[INFO]    Slug:      <auto>\\n[INFO]    Image ID:  65\\n[INFO]    Status:    draft (draft)\\n[INFO]  ================================================\\n[INFO]  Clean article: /tmp/crypto-article-clean.md\\n[INFO]  Review draft:  https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=66?preview=true\\nSUCCESS: https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=66\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":8301,\"aggregated\":\"[INFO]  Parsing article — extracting metadata and stripping pipeline internals...\\n[INFO]  META block extracted:\\n[INFO]    SEO Title:        \\n[INFO]    Meta Description: \\n[INFO]    URL Slug:         \\n[INFO]  Clean article written to /tmp/crypto-article-clean.md\\n[INFO]  Title source: H1 heading (META block not found)\\n[INFO]  Excerpt source: firs